#34502
The Entry Hall~
You are standing in the entryway of an abandoned temple.  The ceiling is
supported by ceiling-to-floor arches of an unknown material and the wall are
covered with fading pictures of a figure dressed in black leading armies of
followers into battle.  There is a thin layer of dust covering the floor and
in it you can make out the tracks of bare human-like feet leading both north
and south.  This hallway continues to the south and you see double doors to
the north.  
~
