are included in the pattern on the wall, red , and variations of red, is the
dominant color.  Because of the unique markings on the walls, you find it is
impossible to determine exactly how far the corridor extends.  It appears to
extend into infinity, but surely that must be an optical illusion.  Or is it?
The corridor extends to the east and west.
~
