#34682
Inside a Large Pit~
You are standing in a large hole in the ground.  As far as you can tell, the
hole was created naturally, by the elements, over many years.  Looking around,
you see the southern portion of this cavernous depression is quite a bit lower
than the northern part and has a small amount of water standing in it.  In the
northern portion you see crudely cut stairs that lead down into the darkness
beyond your vision.  On the ground, you see footprints of a humanoid creature.
From your best estimates, the creature is a fair bit larger than a human but
not near the size of a troll.  From here you can use the vines to climb out of
the pit or follow the stairs down into the darkness.
~
